// CotSC localization Batch 23: QCBFOREST
@1 = ~(You find yourself in an unfamiliar forest. Ahead, a vast temple rises above the trees. Unlike your memories of Candlekeep, nothing here seems visibly twisted or distorted. Yet the place feels no less unsettling. There appears to be only one way forward: towards the temple.)~
@2 = ~That symbol... Bhaal. We are in one of his domains. I do not remember this place. Why would your consciousness conjure it? Something is wrong.~
@3 = ~Big, mosquito-infested dump. What sort o' twisted memories are ye keepin' in that little head o' yours?~
@4 = ~Boo's hackles went straight up! He does not like the look of this place. Malicious evil dwells in this forest. Whatever your mind has cooked up, we had better be ready for some solid butt-kicking!~
@5 = ~(You find yourself in an unfamiliar forest. Ahead, a vast temple rises above the trees. Unlike your memories of Candlekeep, nothing here seems visibly twisted or distorted. Yet the place feels no less unsettling. There appears to be only one way forward: towards the temple.)~
@6 = ~That symbol... Bhaal. We are in one of his domains. I do not remember this place. Why would your consciousness conjure it? Something is wrong.~
