@8 = ~Boo's hackles went straight up! He does not like the look of this place. Malicious evil dwells in this forest. Whatever your mind has cooked up, we had better be ready for some solid butt-kicking!~
@9 = ~(You find yourself in an unfamiliar forest. Ahead, a vast temple rises above the trees. Unlike your memories of Candlekeep, nothing here seems visibly twisted or distorted. Yet the place feels no less unsettling. There appears to be only one way forward: towards the temple.)~
@10 = ~That symbol... Bhaal. We are in one of his domains. I do not remember this place. Why would your consciousness conjure it? Something is wrong.~
@11 = ~Big, mosquito-infested dump. What sort o' twisted memories are ye keepin' in that little head o' yours?~
@12 = ~Boo's hackles went straight up! He does not like the look of this place. Malicious evil dwells in this forest. Whatever your mind has cooked up, we had better be ready for some solid butt-kicking!~
@13 = ~I... I know this place.~
@14 = ~You do?~
@15 = ~That's impossible. We haven't visited anywhere like this before.~
@16 = ~We never stumbled upon this place in our travels, and I haven't been here myself, either. But... I feel a strange pull towards it. I recognise it, even if I cannot tell from where.~
@17 = ~No, we haven't. We never stumbled upon this place in our travels, and I haven't been here myself, either. But... I feel a strange pull towards it. I recognise it, even if I cannot tell from where.~
@18 = ~We should... we should keep going. We must be close to the core now.~
@19 = ~I... I know this place.~
@20 = ~You do?~
@21 = ~That's impossible. We haven't visited anywhere like this before.~
@22 = ~We never stumbled upon this place in our travels, and I haven't been here myself, either. But... I feel a strange pull towards it. I recognise it, even if I cannot tell from where.~
@23 = ~No, we haven't. We never stumbled upon this place in our travels, and I haven't been here myself, either. But... I feel a strange pull towards it. I recognise it, even if I cannot tell from where.~
@24 = ~We should... we should keep going. We must be close to the core now.~
@25 = ~You're here! We need help inside!~
@26 = ~What...?~
@27 = ~What...?~
@28 = ~What...?~
@29 = ~There's no time! Gorion needs help! Quick!~
@30 = ~I know this woman. She is a high-ranking Harper, currently residing in Murann. But something is wrong. You have never met her. Your mind should not be capable of conjuring such a memory.~
@31 = ~There's no time! Gorion needs help! Quick!~
@32 = ~I know this woman. She is a high-ranking Harper, currently residing in Murann. But something is wrong. You have never met her. Your mind should not be capable of conjuring such a memory.~
@33 = ~There's no time! Gorion needs help! Quick!~
@34 = ~I know this woman. She is a high-ranking Harper, currently residing in Murann. But something is wrong. You have never met her. Your mind should not be capable of conjuring such a memory.~
@35 = ~Temple... of Bhaal. Gorion...~
@36 = ~Imoen? What is it?~
@37 = ~It's... nothing. Let's go inside.~
@38 = ~Temple... of Bhaal. Gorion...~
@39 = ~Imoen? What is it?~
@40 = ~It's... nothing. Let's go inside.~
@41 = ~<CHARNAME>? May I have a word?~
@42 = ~What is it, Hexxat?~
@43 = ~Not now. Not in this place.~
@44 = ~She's hiding things from you.~
@45 = ~Imoen?~
@46 = ~I saw that glint in her eyes. I know what a woman is thinking when I look into her eyes. I saw excitement... and dread.~
@47 = ~Imoen isn't telling you everything. She is hoarding the truth about this place. You must decide whether you wish to remain in the dark or press onwards and learn what this place truly is.~
@48 = ~Thank the gods you're so pragmatic.~
@49 = ~I've noticed her reactions, but she suffered a great deal recently. She might just...~
@50 = ~Thanks for your insight.~
@51 = ~You keep me around for a reason. Never doubt my intentions. I am here to keep us alive. Now let us go inside.~
@52 = ~No. She is not.~
@53 = ~That is why I am here.~
@54 = ~Who you be?~
@55 = ~Easy. I'm not here to hurt you. We are investigating this temple.~
@56 = ~We're just adventurers.~
@57 = ~We hate ogre mages, and we hunt them for sport. You know what that means.~
@58 = ~Temple... bad place. Evil. You be dead if go there. You not go there. Cultists... ritual...~
@59 = ~Sacrifice at the altar... priests of the dead god. Lord of Murder.~
@60 = ~Sacrifice? Who is being sacrificed?~
@61 = ~I have to get inside. Thank you for the warning.~
@62 = ~Children... many innocent children. Human, elven, halfling... more.~
@63 = ~Me here to avenge. They kill my mate, burn him alive. Me here to return favour. Go now... me take revenge. You stay outside. Place dangerous.~
@64 = ~I go inside... I kill them for killing my mate. You stay out.~
@65 = ~You be priests of dead god too... You take my mate. You not take me. I kill you, or die fighting!~
